      "ordinal": 304,
      "headword": "אָזַר",
      "ref": "BDB, אָזַר",
      "preview": "אָזַר: verbo cingir, rodear, equipar; qal, nifal, piel e hitpael.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָזַר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: cingir, rodear, equipar (</strong>Talmude <em>idem</em>, árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">أَزَّرَ</span>, aramaico em derivados; Lag<sup> BN 177 deriva de</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">وَزَرَ</span> <strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽזְרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.4\">1 S 2:4</a>; imperfeito com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">יַאַזְרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:18\" href=\"/Job.30.18\">Jb 30:18</a>; 2ª pessoa masc. sing. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּאֱזוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.17\">Je 1:17</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱזָר־נָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:3\" href=\"/Job.38.3\">Jb 38:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 40:7\" href=\"/Job.40.7\">40:7</a>; particípio passivo <span dir=\"rtl\">אָזוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.8\">2 K 1:8</a>;—<em>cingir, colocar ao redor</em>, seguido de acusativo de coisa: <em>lombos</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלָצֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:3\" href=\"/Job.38.3\">Jb 38:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 40:7\" href=\"/Job.40.7\">40:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מָחְנֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.17\">Je 1:17</a>; passivo, com <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵזוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאֵזוֹר עוֹר אָזוּר בְּמָתְנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.8\">2 K 1:3</a>; cf. uso ativo com acusativo de pessoa <a data-ref=\"Job 30:18\" href=\"/Job.30.18\">Jb 30:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּפִי כֻתָּנְתִּי יַאַזְרֵנִי</span>, sujeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבוּשִׁי</span>; ver Di; figuradamente <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.4\">1 S 2:4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אָֽזְרוּ חַיִל</span>.<br><strong>Nifal</strong>  particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶאְזָר</span> figuradamente <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:7\" href=\"/Psalms.65.7\">ψ 65:7</a> acerca de Deus <span dir=\"rtl\">(נ׳ בִּגְבוּרָה)</span> <em>cingido de poder</em>.<br><strong>Piel</strong>  imperfeito, 2ª pessoa masc. sing. com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתְּאַזְּרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:40\" href=\"/Psalms.18.40\">ψ 18:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:12\" href=\"/Psalms.30.12\">30:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתַּזְרִנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:40\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.40\">2 S 22:40</a> (Ges<sup>§ 68 R 2</sup>); particípio com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּאַזְּרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:33\" href=\"/Psalms.18.33\">ψ 18:33</a>; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאַזְּרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.11\">Is 50:11</a> mas cf. adiante.—<em>cingir</em>, com dois acusativos (pessoa e coisa), figuradamente <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:40\" href=\"/Psalms.18.40\">ψ 18:40</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:40\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.40\">2 S 22:40</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:33\" href=\"/Psalms.18.33\">ψ 18:33</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(חַיִל)</span>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 30:12\" href=\"/Psalms.30.12\">ψ 30:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(שִׂמְחָה)</span>; acusativo de coisa omitido <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.5\">Is 45:5</a>; acusativo de pessoa omitido <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאַזְּרֵי זִיקוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.11\">Is 50:11</a>; mas é preferível ler <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאִירֵי</span> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.11\">27:11</a> (𝔖 Kn Brd Di).<br><strong>Hitpael</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְאַזָּ֑ר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:1\" href=\"/Psalms.93.1\">ψ 93:1</a>; imperativo <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְאַזְּרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.9\">Is 8:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>—<em>cingir-se</em>, para a guerra <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.9\">Is 8:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 93:1\" href=\"/Psalms.93.1\">ψ 93:1</a> (sujeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>).",
