      "preview": "אָחָז: Acaz; nome próprio masculino, rei de Judá e descendente de Jônatas.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָחָז</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>ele agarrou</em>; abreviação de <span dir=\"rtl\">יהואחז</span> (ver verbete); cf. assírio <em>Ia-u-ḫa-zi</em> (isto é, Acaz), COT acerca de <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.8\">2 K 16:8</a><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  rei de Judá, filho de Jotão e pai de Ezequias <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:38\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.38\">2 K 15:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.1\">16:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:7\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 16:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.16.8\">8</a> + 13 ocorrências em 2Rs; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.1\">Is 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.1\">7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.28\">14:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.8\">38:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.13\">1 Ch 3:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 27:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.27.9\">2 Ch 27:9</a> + 8 ocorrências em 2Cr; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:1\" href=\"/Hosea.1.1\">Ho 1:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:1\" href=\"/Micah.1.1\">Mi 1:1</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  filho de Mica e bisneto de Jônatas <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.35\">1 Ch 8:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.42\">9:42</a> (+ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:41\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.41\">9:41</a>; cf. 𝔊L 𝔙).",
