      "preview": "אֲחֻזָּה: substantivo feminino, posse ou propriedade, inclusive herança e propriedade fundiária.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֻזָּה</span></big><sub>66</sub>  <strong>subst. fem.: posse, propriedade</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:11\" href=\"/Genesis.47.11\">Gn 47:11</a> + 11 ocorrências; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֻזַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:8\" href=\"/Genesis.17.8\">Gn 17:8</a> + 21 ocorrências; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֻזָּתְֽךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:8\" href=\"/Psalms.2.8\">ψ 2:8</a>; — <em>posse, propriedade</em>, em P e textos tardios; de propriedade fundiária <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:11\" href=\"/Genesis.47.11\">Gn 47:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.34\">Lv 14:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.10\">25:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.33\">33</a> (casas), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:41\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.41\">41</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:45\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.45\">45</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:46\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.46\">46</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:4\" href=\"/Numbers.27.4\">Nu 27:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:5\" href=\"/Numbers.32.5\">32:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:22\" href=\"/Numbers.32.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:29\" href=\"/Numbers.32.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:8\" href=\"/Numbers.35.8\">35:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:49\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.49\">Dt 32:49</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:12\" href=\"/Joshua.21.12\">Jos 21:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:39\" href=\"/Joshua.21.39\">39</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.28\">Ez 44:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.5\">45:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.7\">7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.8\">8</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.18\">46:18</a><sup>(×3)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.20\">48:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.22\">22</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.28\">1 Ch 7:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.2\">9:2</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 11:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.11.14\">2 Ch 11:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.1\">31:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.3\">Ne 11:3</a>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ אֲחֻזָּה</span> = <em>terra possuída, terra própria</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:43\" href=\"/Genesis.36.43\">Gn 36:43</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.34\">Lv 14:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.24\">25:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:28\" href=\"/Numbers.35.28\">Nu 35:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:4\" href=\"/Joshua.22.4\">Jos 22:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:9\" href=\"/Joshua.22.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:19\" href=\"/Joshua.22.19\">19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲחֻזַּת\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲחֻזַּת\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֻזַּת הָאָרֶץ</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.24\">Lv 27:24</a>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂדֶה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ אֲחֻזָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.16\">Lv 27:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.28\">28</a>; cf. versículo <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.21\">21</a>; com <span dir=\"rtl\">עִור</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ אֲחֻזָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.32\">Lv 25:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.33\">33</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֻזַּת נַחֲלָה</span> = <em>posse por direito de herança</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:7\" href=\"/Numbers.27.7\">Nu 27:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:32\" href=\"/Numbers.32.32\">32:32</a>; e <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלַת א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:2\" href=\"/Numbers.35.2\">35:2</a>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ בְּנַחֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.16\">Ez 46:16</a> (mas Co propõe como em <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:7\" href=\"/Numbers.27.7\">Nu 27:7</a>; assim B); <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֻזַּת קֶבֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:4\" href=\"/Genesis.23.4\">Gn 23:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:9\" href=\"/Genesis.23.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:20\" href=\"/Genesis.23.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:30\" href=\"/Genesis.49.30\">49:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:13\" href=\"/Genesis.50.13\">50:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ עוֹלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:8\" href=\"/Genesis.17.8\">Gn 17:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 48:4\" href=\"/Genesis.48.4\">48:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.34\">Lv 25:34</a>; na promessa ao rei davídico <span dir=\"rtl\">וַאֲחֻזָּתְֽךָ אַסְפֵי־אָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:8\" href=\"/Psalms.2.8\">ψ 2:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלָה</span> ); figuradamente, de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> como porção dos sacerdotes levíticos <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.28\">Ez 44:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחֲלָה</span>).",
