      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַזְיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַזְיָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַחְזַי</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino (</strong><em>Yah</em>(<em>u</em>) <em> agarrou; </em> 𝔊 Ὀχοζ(ε)ιας <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:52\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.52\">1 K 22:52</a> etc.; cf. Lag <sup>BN 53</sup><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  rei de Israel, filho de Acabe <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:40\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.40\">1 K 22:40</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:50\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.50\">50</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:52\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.52\">52</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.18\">2 K 1:18</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:37\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.37\">2 Ch 20:37</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲחַזְיָהוּ)</span>; mais <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.2\">2 K 1:2</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:35\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.35\">2 Ch 20:35</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲחַזְיָה)</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  rei de Judá, filho de Jorão <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.24\">2 K 8:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.21\">9:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 10:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.10.13\">10:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.1\">11:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.19\">12:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.1\">13:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 14:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.14.13\">14:13</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.11\">1 Ch 3:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.1\">2 Ch 22:1</a> + <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1\" href=\"/II_Kings.1\">2 K 1</a> [a abreviatura «Ch» segue esta referência no original digital; indicação bibliográfica não resolvida] (todas as passagens com <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַזְיָהוּ</span>); <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.16\">2 K 9:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:27\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.2\">11:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲחַזְיָה)</span>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אַחְזַי</span> sacerdote <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.13\">Ne 11:13</a> (em lugar do qual aparece <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְזֵרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.12\">1 Ch 9:12</a>; ver Sm <sup>Listen, Tafel</sup>); cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">احّ</span> na VIII forma e <span dir=\"rtl\">إِخّ</span> = <em>adotar</em>; daí talvez <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>tenha adotado</em>.",
