      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָחוֹר</span></big><sub>41</sub>  <strong>substantivo</strong> (árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">أُخُرٌ</span>) a <strong>parte posterior, parte de trás</strong>; no singular, sobretudo em expressões adverbiais: — <br> <strong>a.</strong>  como acusativo, na poesia, <em>para trás</em> em 23 ocorrências (= prosa <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֹרַנִּית</span>); com verbos como <span dir=\"rtl\">נָפַל</span> <em>cair</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:17\" href=\"/Genesis.49.17\">Gn 49:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָשׂוֹג</span> <em>voltar-se</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.22\">2 S 1:22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּשׁוּב רֵיקָם</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:4\" href=\"/Psalms.9.4\">ψ 9:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 56:10\" href=\"/Psalms.56.10\">56:10</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָסוֹג</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:4\" href=\"/Psalms.35.4\">35:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 40:15\" href=\"/Psalms.40.15\">40:15</a> + (de inimigos repelidos), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:19\" href=\"/Psalms.44.19\">44:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 50:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.50.5\">Is 50:5</a> (da obediência a Deus), <span dir=\"rtl\">נָזוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.4\">Is 1:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵשִׁיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.25\">44:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:11\" href=\"/Psalms.44.11\">ψ 44:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הִכָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:66\" href=\"/Psalms.78.66\">78:66</a>; <em>atrás</em> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶדֶם</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 139:5\" href=\"/Psalms.139.5\">ψ 139:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 23:8\" href=\"/Job.23.8\">Jb 23:8</a>; na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּנִים וְאָחוֹר</span> à frente e <em>atrás</em> † <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.10\">1 Ch 19:10</a> (alterado de <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפָּ׳ וּמֵאָ׳</span> em 2Sm, versículo citado adiante) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.14\">2 Ch 13:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 2:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.2.10\">Ez 2:10</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאָחוֹר</span> †<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.11\">Pr 29:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָכָם בְּאָחוֹר יְשַׁבְּחֶנָּה</span> ; Ges e Hi: mas o sábio a acalma (<span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ</span> ira) <em>para trás</em> (isto é, quando está prestes a irromper); De: <em>no íntimo</em>, isto é, de seu coração (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־רוּחוֹ יוֹצִיא כְסִיל</span>). <strong>c.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">לְאָחוֹר</span> (α) como em <strong>a.</strong> †<a data-ref=\"Psalms 114:3\" href=\"/Psalms.114.3\">ψ 114:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 114:5\" href=\"/Psalms.114.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.24\">Je 7:24</a>; (β) quanto ao tempo: <em>daqui em diante</em> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְפָּנִים</span> = antes) † <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.23\">Is 41:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.23\">42:23</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵאָחוֹר</span> <em>atrás</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span> = do lado de) † <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.9\">2 S 10:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפָּנִים וּמֵ׳</span> à frente e <em>atrás</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.11\">Is 9:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וּפְלִשְׁתִּים מֵאָ׳</span> ; e os filisteus <em>atrás</em> (= a oeste), em oposição a <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרָם מִקֶּדֶם</span>.<br>†<strong>Plural</strong>  estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחֹרֵי</span> <strong>parte posterior</strong> (do tabernáculo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:12\" href=\"/Exodus.26.12\">Ex 26:12</a>; de um homem ou animal) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.25\">1 K 7:25</a> (= <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.4\">2 Ch 4:4</a>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.16\">Ez 8:16</a> ; de Deus <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:23\" href=\"/Exodus.33.23\">Ex 33:23</a>.",
